## 5. Summary Table

Library Type | Extension | Linking Time | Executable Size | Dependencies | Update
------------ | --------- | ------------ | --------------- | ------------ | ------
Static       | .a        | Compile      | Large           | None         | Recompile
Dynamic      | .so       | Load/Run     | Small           | Yes          | Replace .so

